'''The Shattered Divinity''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Blunt Arrow Quiver}}.

==Mechanics==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts ''The Shattered Divinity'' on the player. ''The Shattered Divinity'' is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 4 seconds, granting one or all of the following: <br>
* Fire 2 additional Projectiles <br>
* [[Chain]] 2 additional times <br>
* Projectiles [[Pierce]] 2 additional targets <br>
* Projectiles [[Fork]] then Fork an additional time

This version doubles the projectile modifier bonuses of each buff. In case for Fork, it Forks twice.

The cooldown of ''The Shattered Divinity'' buff is '''not''' scaled by player cooldown reduction, only the summoning of the harbinger itself, which has a 6 second cooldown.

See {{sl|Summon Greater Harbinger of Directions}} for more information.

